    "detailed_description": "&quot;Brick Buster Blast&quot; is a classic arcade game where you smash through bricks using your mouse-controlled paddle. Collect power-ups for extra abilities as you progress through levels. It's simple, addictive, and perfect for players of all ages. Can you blast your way to victory?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Gameplay: Experience fast-paced and engaging gameplay as you aim, shoot, and bounce your ball to demolish bricks.<br />\r\n- Power-Ups: Collect a variety of power-ups such as extra balls, laser cannons, and size modifiers to help you clear levels faster.<br />\r\n- Challenging Obstacles: Encounter challenging obstacles like moving platforms, indestructible blocks, and tricky brick formations that test your skills and reflexes.<br />\r\n- Multiple Levels: Enjoy countless levels of increasing difficulty, each with unique layouts and challenges to keep you entertained for hours.<br />\r\n- Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in the game's retro-inspired soundtrack and sound effects, enhancing the overall gaming experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready to embark on a brick-busting adventure like never before with &quot;Brick Buster Blast!",
